		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"eval", exp="g.no113=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060010"},
		line=2471,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A miracle. That is all it could be described as.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A blinding ray of light descends from the sun above before being redirected, as though by divine will─",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"To strike down the priestess named Yagi Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Kh...! I-It cannot be...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"A gaping wound piercing her stomach, Sekka stumbles several steps forward in disbelief before collapsing to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kotone simply stares vacantly at the scene before her.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin & Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone!” “Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"As soon as the sky clears, I find myself able to move once again.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Akari and I rush up to Kotone's side.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... Akari-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, I am quite all right...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Kotone slowly blinks her unfocused eyes, as though rousing herself from a waking dream.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“This is... primeval magicks...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The truest manifestation of Oomikami's divinity... a miracle wrought free of any karmic distortions...”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Sekka murmurs, the crimson stain on her uniform slowly expanding.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She's in absolutely no condition to put up any further resistance.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san... You have my deepest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If only I were able to save you too.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Aren't you a goody two-shoes, apologizing to your enemy...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“No wonder Oomikami listened to your prayer... hah... heheh...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Blood drips from her mouth as she chuckles bitterly to herself.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But whatever... I've gotten what I came here for...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Sekka's hand slips open, revealing the spiderweb of cracks on a jeweled orb that seems like it could shatter at any moment.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“What a terrible priestess you are... Smashing up your\npredecessor's legacy just like that...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But all thanks to you... His power can finally be restored...”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“His? Who are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Before Sekka can answer, a mellifluous melody drifts in on the wind behind us.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"My body freezes in place before I even realize it.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"I've heard this melody before.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Over and over in the halls of the academy─",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"No...",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Ever further back...",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"This is a melody I've known for thousands of─",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Heya, Soujin. Haven't seen you since this summer.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"His blond hair catches the sun as it flutters in the breeze.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Believe it or not, I'm actually the commander in charge of the Inner Iseya Expeditionary Force.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Though, it looks like the whole unit's been wiped out already.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you here to fight us?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“No, no, fighting you now wouldn't be fun at all.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Besides, you aren't in any state to take me on just yet.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Hmm, you still don't get it?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Gosh, you sure do know how to keep a guy in suspense.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"He shows no signs of hostility towards us, but we still can't afford to let down our guard.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Rochel... sama...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Well done, Sekka.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You've never looked more beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Your jesting... wounds me...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Blood spills from her lips, quirked up in a helpless smile.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“No, I really do mean it.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Kneeling down beside her, Rochel takes the fractured orb in his hand.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You've done me proud.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Thank you very much... Rochel-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I no longer have... any regrets...”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Rest now. I still have much I'll need your help with moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"With that, Rochel turns back towards us.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Shiinoha-san, I believe I owe you my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I beg your pardon? Whatever might you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You were the one who smashed apart this orb, weren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Rochel shows us the broken orb in his hand.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“The former Exalt-Priestess was an exemplary personage.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Why, she placed the peace of the Empire over even her own life.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You know how my predecessor met her end?!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Yes, I'm well aware. After all─”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I was the one who killed her.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“*Gasp!*”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kotone's expression freezes over.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh... Why...? Why would you do such a thing?!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“To disable the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“With that thing in working order, even the mighty Republic couldn't hope to conquer the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"So it was Rochel who destroyed the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“And to think, she could have escaped with her life, but still chose to sacrifice herself to seal away a certain thing.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Now then, what do you suppose that might be?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Rochel looks around at us.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"None of us offers any answer.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Nobody knows?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“In that case, allow me to show you.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Rochel crushes the orb in his hand.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"The moment the orb splinters apart, all my hair immediately stands on its end.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Ahh... Now I am complete.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Rochel is no longer the same man he was just a few seconds ago.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Behind his serene smile, a chill like the depths of the seafloor in midwinter seeps forth.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"A penetrating cold, one that does not merely numb the body.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Rather, an endlessly dark, endlessly malignant chill that threatens to freeze the soul and shatter it to pieces.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"A chill that I could never possibly forget.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh, it looks like Soujin's come up with the answer.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“That's right. What the Exalt-Priestess sealed away was... ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"my power.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“The seal she applied was impressively elaborate, and neither Sekka nor I could undo it.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“And so, we needed a priestess with even more powerful magicks to destroy it for us.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Then what you were after from the very start was...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Exactly. I always knew it'd be doable so long as you unleashed your full power.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“But even I didn't expect you to invoke Oomikami's divine intervention to get it done.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“In the Republic, that's what we'd call ≪overkill.≫”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Sekka's true objective was to have Kotone destroy the orb.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"That's why she kept her alive this whole time.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who are you? Name yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Alas, what a tragic fate it is to be forgotten by you, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Rochel's declaration solidifies my premonition into conviction.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you mean, 'Himi-no-Mikoto'?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san... Or rather, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Your Imperial",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"Highness.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Contained within your personage is the inheritance of\nHimi-no-Mikoto's power.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“When I saw you in Tenkyo for the very first time, it shook me to the core.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Why, that sublime beauty, that rarified dignity of yours─it could belong to none other than Himi-no-Mikoto herself!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“And on top of that, the fact that you were being protected by Mitsurugi left absolutely no doubt in my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Rochel declares, turning his gaze towards me.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Even after two thousand long years... I always knew that you surely could not have perished.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I always knew that no matter how long it took, you would eventually return to me, Himi-no-Mikoto!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What are you even talking about? I-I'm─”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Ahaah, I can hardly hold myself back... I want nothing more than to make you scream right this very second.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Rochel directs his ecstatic expression towards the sky.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“But I mustn't! I have to endure!”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Killing you here and now wouldn't be any fun at all.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto, the occasion of your death... demands a stage more beautiful than any other.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Rochel shows us a truly hideous smile.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"I know of only one being capable of making such a sinister expression.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"That direful spring of calamities that has tirelessly pursued Mitsurugi through the ages─",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"That abominable nemesis of the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"And─",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"He who murdered Himi-no-Mikoto.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you the Kahaku of this age?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Right in one, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Or perhaps I should be calling you Mitsurugi instead.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“After all, you've finally managed to regain your memories.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"I wordlessly tighten the grip on my spellblade in response.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"But before I can do anything else, Rochel's figure begins shimmering like a mirage.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hold your horses, Mitsurugi, old chap.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“You know full well I'm not the most handy fellow with a blade.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"The spitting image of Tooru replies in his easygoing manner.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You can change your appearance?!”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Indeed, Himi-no-Mikoto. Only to those I've personally killed, though.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Once again, you have my sincere gratitude for breaking that orb and restoring my powers.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kahaku, cease your tasteless mockery.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, what's the harm, Mitsurugi? It's important to enjoy yourself once in a while, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I level the tip of my blade at the creature before me.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't you dare defile Tooru!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hahahahaha, because he was your friend?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I needn't justify myself to the likes of you.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Separated cleanly from his shoulders, his head tumbles across the ground like a ball.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Was it really necessary to kill him?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Look.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Whoa there, Mitsurugi, don't scare me like that!”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"His rolling head jeers at me with an amused expression.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Just as before, I'm unable to slay him.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"There's no more room for doubt.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Rochel is Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"His decapitated body shimmers once more, and in the next instant, his head is restored.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“How many times has it been that you've killed me now?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Aaaahh, this ecstasy... I never get tired of it.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Killing is great in its own right, but let me tell you─nothing beats this feeling of being killed.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Kahaku gleefully declares, as though appraising the taste of a delightful new recipe.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“How's about you, Mitsurugi? How's it feel lopping off the head of your rival in love?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You are nothing of the sort.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh? Do you seriously not remember?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You tried to set this guy up with Himi-no-Mikoto, only to turn around and screw her brains out instead!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I hear Akari's breath catch in her throat.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's enough.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why must you always appear before me? What is your purpose?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hmm, can't say I know all too well myself.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Though if what Sekka says is true, Mitsurugi, you and I are of the same ilk.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“For as long as you continue to cut down all calamity befalling the Empire, I'll be right there bringing more and more calamity upon the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Kahaku shows me a wide smile.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"In contrast to his words, his smile is as light and carefree as the spring breeze.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“In simple terms, I suppose that means our battle will continue on for all eternity.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“After all, you'd be awfully bored without anyone around to kill, wouldn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, kill me and be done with it. Don't you dare involve others.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ooh, finally starting to sound just like Mitsurugi, aren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Answer me!”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why will you not satisfy yourself with killing me?!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I told you loud and clear, didn't I? Mine is to bring calamity upon all the Empire, not just you alone.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But between you and me, I want nothing more than to see you and Himi-no-Mikoto suffer as much as possible before you die.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The scourge of the Empire...”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“None other than yours truly.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then you sided with the Republic all in order to...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“That's right. All in order to destroy the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Or rather, that's the reason I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"created",
{"/font"},
" the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You created... the Republic?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Sure did. Three hundred-odd years ago, I voyaged across the sea to bring forth a new nation.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I tell you, it sure wasn't easy! Don't even get me started or\nI'll never be able to stop.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then the war three years ago was also...”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The sight of the Warrior District in flames was so beautiful that it nearly brought a tear to my eye.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The screams of all those proud warriors who defended the Empire burning to a crisp!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If you ask me, it was my most exquisite work to date.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“As shameful as it is to admit, I must have climaxed at least five times as I watched it all burn.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"The Republic's invasion of the Empire, the deaths of so many warriors─all of it was Kahaku's doing.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You fiend...”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“That's it, Mitsurugi. That's the face I've been longing to see.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It's truly... beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“All these indecent urges coursing through my body, I can hardly contain them!”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You still dare to mock us?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Akari directs the full furor of her gaze towards Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"A fiery passion, a black and murderous rage emanates from the whole of her being.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ahahaha, that's one fine expression you're making!”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Akari's voice sets the air atremble.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" answer for your crimes.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I vow it... on my life, I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" see you breathe your last!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Music to my ears.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But you know, I'll just come back again and again.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Fine by me. You do just that.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll grant you another death for every last life you've snuffed out.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A thousand times, a million times, as many times as it takes!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Every last strand of her hair radiates her overwhelming fury.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"I've never seen Akari aroused to such incandescent anger.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ah, that virtue, that nobility... You truly are beautiful enough to steal the breath away.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I'd expect nothing less from the inheritor of\nHimi-no-Mikoto's...”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“No, you're more than beautiful enough in your own right.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I've been treating you as a substitute for Himi-no-Mikoto this whole time, but you've managed to get my blood boiling all on your own!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Silence, peon!”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The time for talk is over.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Agreed.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"I ready my spellblade once again.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, silence this cur!”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh dear.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"My opening attack severs Kahaku's left hand from his body.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"But my follow-up is met by a shower of sparks.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Kahaku should have been unarmed, but his right hand is now clutching a jet-black blade.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Where in the world could it have come from?",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You're putting up a better fight than when you were in Tenkyo, but you're still a far cry from Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hmm, what's getting in the way of Mitsurugi's awakening?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Maybe you need a kiss from Himi-no-Mikoto, like in those foreign fairy tales?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"Kahaku cocks his head as though considering a ponderous dilemma.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin! Kill him!”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your will be done!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"I knock aside Kahaku's blade while he's lost in thought.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"As he tries to reset his stance─",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"I take advantage of the opening.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Stepping in to swing at his defenseless flank, I─",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh?!”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"I try to pull my left leg back, but I'm unable to move.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"I look down to find Kahaku's severed hand clinging to my ankle.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Guuuh!”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"Suddenly unable to support my weight, my left leg collapses underneath me.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"What... just happened?",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"I look towards my enfeebled left leg.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh...!”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"All the bones in my ankle have been shattered.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Crushed by Kahaku's severed hand.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Only then do I realize the searing pain from my right shoulder─",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"A short distance away, my arm─severed cleanly from my torso─lies on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“This is still me going easy on you, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“No, to call you Mitsurugi would be an insult to your creator, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“As you are now, you're nothing more than a simple warrior, Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am...!”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" Tokita Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"What Kahaku says is not wrong.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"But for that exact reason, I'm loath to admit that I'm absolutely no match for my sworn enemy.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Akari moves to rush to my side.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stay back!”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll see your will done, just watch me!”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Akari silently bites down on her lip.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“...Ah, I see. So that's how it is, eh?”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Gotta admit I wasn't expecting this.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Kahaku ruefully scratches his head.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"At some point, his severed hand had reattached itself.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I think I get what's going on.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"Kahaku points his jet-black spellblade at Akari, standing in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You're the one getting in the way of Mitsurugi's awakening, Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The strong bond between you and Soujin is what's keeping Mitsurugi sealed away deep inside him.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not getting in the way of anything.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh, please. It's clear as day that you're scared of Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You're scared that Soujin will cast you aside and go running off to Himi-no-Mikoto, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh─?!”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“And what's more, you're scared to open yourself up to\nHimi-no-Mikoto's power laying dormant within you.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“'I don't want to give up my body to some other woman\nI've never even met.'”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“'I want Soujin to love me as ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"me,",
{"/font"},
" as Miyaguni Akari.' Isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No! I-I...”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Her words slowly trail off into nothingness.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san, you haven't changed one bit since this spring.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Have you already forgotten what happened when I kidnapped you back then?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Akari's eyes go wide.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kahaku... You were the one who kidnapped Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Yes, that's right.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“After aaall this time, I'd finally been reunited with Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi, but both of you'd completely forgotten your own powers.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“So you could hardly blame me for going out of my way to give you two a helping hand, right?”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But from the looks of things, all I did was make things even worse.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Back then, Akari said that she only saw a bad dream, but she must have really been talking to Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, what really happened to you back then?”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Akari says nothing, biting hard on her lip.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“To put it simply, I asked her which was more important─your life, or the restoration of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“And in the end, Miyaguni-san chose your life.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“'I'll give up on Okonogi! Please, just spare Soujin─'”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop!”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please, stop it...”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"Akari hangs her trembling head.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Kotone gently places a hand on her shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I might have ended up bullying her to tears.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" one of my favorite pastimes after all, so please do forgive me.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"Kahaku graciously inclines his head towards us.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But don't come off thinking Miyaguni-san is the only one to blame, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi's only holding himself back because you can't stop obsessing over your relationship with Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am... my lord's blade...!”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Need I remind you, that lord is Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh, how you loved each other so! Have you already forgotten?”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Kahaku is right. I do treasure my bond with Akari more than anything else.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"And one look at Akari's anguished expression tells me that\nhe's right about her feelings as well.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Soujin, repent.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"Kahaku vanishes before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ngh...!”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"In the next instant, he strikes Akari a heavy blow.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"My eyes are incapable of even following his movements.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"Even if I weren't bleeding profusely, I would never be able to close the gap between our abilities.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“H-H-How dare you touch Akari-sam─”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Now, now.”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hyaah...!”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Kotone, too, is sent sprawling across the ground by Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I hate to bring it up, but isn't Little Miss Exalt-Priestess here the only one who's living up to her part?”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“She didn't hesitate to throw away her own life to draw out even a little bit of Mitsurugi's power. How truly admirable.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"As he prattles on, Kahaku heaves Akari's body over his shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"This is bad. Very bad.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"What am I doing, crawling around on the ground at a time like this?",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Kahaku!”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"Supporting my weight with my blade, I heave myself upright.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			{
"My crippled leg, completely useless. My severed arm, laying on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"But that doesn't mean I can't still fight.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If you can't get over Miyaguni-san on your own, I'll have to physically separate the two of you.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold it...!”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You have nothing else to blame but your own patheticness.”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If you weren't so weak, Miyaguni-san would never have─”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“...Ah?”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Suddenly, Kahaku's chest bursts open in a flash of steel.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Touched by Her Highness's jeweled voice, I am recalled from the yon side of death.”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan... dono?”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono has run through Kahaku from behind with his blade.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ooooah!”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			{
"I kick off the ground with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"With only one leg, I'm unable to even land on my feet.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"If I fail to connect this strike, all of Kokuan-dono's intent will be put to naught.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"With all my body's weight behind me, I swing down my spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Tch!”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"As a flash of light, my blade bites into Kahaku's shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooooaaaaaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			{
"I follow through with all my might, severing Kahaku's arm.",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"Akari falls to the ground, and I tumble forward with the momentum of my swing.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh, come on!”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Soujin, well done!”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono heaves his blade─still embedded in\nKahaku's chest─upwards.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"The blade cleaves through his ribcage until it reaches his shoulder blade.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Defiler of the Imperial Family, thou comest with me!”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Impressive gall for one so aged.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"Seemingly unconcerned about the gaping wound in his chest, Kahaku leans forward, lowering his stance.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But I'm afraid I can't accompany you where you're going.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Gh?!”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"Kahaku leisurely swings his arm backwards, catching Kokuan-dono in the face with his closed fist.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"The blow is enough to send Kokuan-dono tumbling like a ragdoll.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"Sailing a dozen meters through the air, he lands heavily and does not get up again.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Phew, that sure gave me a real fright.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"As Kahaku lets out a sigh, his severed arm and gaping chest wound reknit themselves whole as though nothing ever happened.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You monster!”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You aren't any different.”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			{
"Still smiling, Kahaku raises his foot─",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gwaaaaarghh!”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"And casually stomps down on my unbroken leg.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I'm still feeling a bit under the weather, so I'll leave it at that for today.”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“In deference to your and the old man's last efforts, I'll leave you Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But in exchange...”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"This time, he lifts up Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I'll be taking the Exalt-Priestess with me.”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold it...! Kaha... ku...”",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Have yourself a niiice, long talk with Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The pathetic Tokita Soujin, or the strong Mitsurugi. Which one do you need right now?”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"Kahaku turns on his heel.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"He pauses to pick up Sekka, collapsed a short distance away, before leaping into the slowly reddening sky.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone...”",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			{
"How could this have happened?",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			{
"Though I managed to protect Akari, I allowed Kotone to be abducted instead.",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Damn it!”",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"I powerlessly pound my fist against the ground.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			{
"One after another, all that I want to protect is slipping through my fingers.",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nmh...”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"Akari slowly blinks open her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, are you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I think so.”",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"Staggering to her feet, Akari looks around at our surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where's that Kahaku guy?”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Long gone.”",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Abducted.”",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No way...”",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"Neither of us says anything to the other.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			{
"It would be so much better if she would just curse me for my weakness.",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Mmmh...”",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			{
"But in that moment, Kokuan-dono stirs with a groan.",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"Akari lends me her shoulder, and we approach where he lays.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Y-Your Highness... It pleases me beyond words to see that thou art unharmed...”",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			{
"A kindly light flickers in Kokuan-dono's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			{
"There's no mistaking it.",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"This is the very same Inou Kokuan-dono who gave me a home and trained me as a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“D-Do you truly recognize us?”",
			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Forgive all the trouble I caused thee, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think nothing of it.”",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll get you treated right away.”",
			},
		},
		[407]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“'Tis no matter. I shall expire all too soon.”",
			},
		},
		[408]={
			{
"As though rejoicing in his own passing, Kokuan-dono peacefully narrows his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[409]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Thy wounds are already beginning to close on their own.”",
			},
		},
		[410]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[411]={
			{
"My limbs severed by Kahaku are indeed no longer bleeding.",
			},
		},
		[412]={
			{
"Even before my eyes, the open wounds slowly stitch themselves shut as new flesh begins to bulge out.",
			},
		},
		[413]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Thou hast finally recovered thy true power...”",
			},
		},
		[414]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono... You knew all along?”",
			},
		},
		[415]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“To watch over thee and protect the warriors until the time came upon us. That was my troth to the Lord Chancellor.”",
			},
		},
		[416]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“But fulfilling it was not meant to be. In the end, I was too feeble to protect anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[417]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono solemnly closes his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[418]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You were in cahoots with Okonogi this whole time.”",
			},
		},
		[419]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“'Tis as thou sayest.”",
			},
		},
		[420]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Being both in our dotage, 'twas all we were capable of...”",
			},
		},
		[421]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“*Cough! Cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[422]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono coughs up a mouthful of blood.",
			},
		},
		[423]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Yet to have been able to save Her Highness in the twilight of my days... 'tis a true honor.”",
			},
		},
		[424]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“No warrior could wish for anything more.”",
			},
		},
		[425]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kokuan...”",
			},
		},
		[426]={
			{
"Akari takes Kokuan-dono's hand in her own.",
			},
		},
		[427]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Your Highness, I have failed thee.”",
			},
		},
		[428]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“To become the enemy's pawn and turn my blade against my own lord... There could be no greater sin.”",
			},
		},
		[429]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It is all in the past, Kokuan. Please be forgiven.”",
			},
		},
		[430]={
			{
"Akari squeezes Kokuan-dono's hand tight.",
			},
		},
		[431]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I thank you for your long devotion to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[432]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall never forget your service for as long as I live.”",
			},
		},
		[433]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Ohh, such immeasurable grace befits me not...”",
			},
		},
		[434]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono's eyes swim with the proof of his fealty.",
			},
		},
		[435]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“We Inous are the blade of the Imperial Family. There could have been no higher honor than to fulfill my duty to Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[436]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“...I entrust Soujin with the─*cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[437]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono!”",
			},
		},
		[438]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“'Twas surely the will of Oomikami that I should regain my senses at the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[439]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“To have been able to receive thy words... was truly a blessing.”",
			},
		},
		[440]={
			{
"Perhaps only due to a trick of the light, the blood staining\nKokuan-dono's face appears to glow with a faint light.",
			},
		},
		[441]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“I would ask but one final thing.”",
			},
		},
		[442]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Is Hotori... in good health?”",
			},
		},
		[443]={
			{
"How should I answer him?",
			},
		},
		[444]={
			{
"The answer is obvious.",
			},
		},
		[445]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course, Kokuan-dono. She is wounded, but her spirit is unbroken.”",
			},
		},
		[446]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“I am glad to hear it...”",
			},
		},
		[447]={
			{
"With a sigh of great relief, the light rapidly fades from his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[448]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono!”",
			},
		},
		[449]={
			{
"Making no response to my scream, a faint smile nevertheless crosses his lips.",
			},
		},
		[450]={
			{
"Thus, Kokuan-dono breathes his last.",
			},
		},
		[451]={
			{
"He was surely able to pass on without any regrets.",
			},
		},
		[452]={
			{
"Sleep well, Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[453]={
			{
"Taking my master's still-warm hands in my own, I gently fold them across his blood-soaked chest.",
			},
		},
		[454]={
			{
"With the battle over, night falls upon Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[455]={
			{
"My severed limbs have been completely restored by the Honing performed by Isuzu and the other priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[456]={
			{
"According to Isuzu, it is able to heal my wounds far more effectively than Healing.",
			},
		},
		[457]={
			{
"Perhaps it might be more accurate to describe my injuries as “damage” rather than “wounds.”",
			},
		},
		[458]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry. I wasn't able to protect Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[459]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“No, we are well aware that you fought desperately with all your life.”",
			},
		},
		[460]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Yet I was so absorbed with activating the Guardian Barrier that I failed to take account of Her Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[461]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've gone far above and beyond in fulfilling your duty.\nI'll not stand for your blaming yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[462]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[463]={
			{
"Isuzu swallows her rebuttal and silently lowers her head.",
			},
		},
		[464]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isuzu, what are the damages to Inner Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[465]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Of our approximately three hundred defenders, only around fifty are still in any fighting condition.”",
			},
		},
		[466]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“With the exception of the Chancel Shrine, all of the other temples have taken extensive damage, and the spellwards protecting Inner Iseya have weakened considerably.”",
			},
		},
		[467]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“With all things considered, I believe it will be unwise to continue using this place as a base of operations.”",
			},
		},
		[468]={
			{
"Isuzu dispassionately delivers her report.",
			},
		},
		[469]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see...”",
			},
		},
		[470]={
			{
"It's a tragic state of affairs.",
			},
		},
		[471]={
			{
"No one can think of anything to say, and an oppressive silence descends upon the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[472]={
			{
"A priestess silently enters the room and whispers in Isuzu's ear.",
			},
		},
		[473]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[474]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“A wounded priest's condition has taken a turn for the worse.”",
			},
		},
		[475]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Might I be permitted to attend to him?”",
			},
		},
		[476]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course. Go ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[477]={
			{
"At Akari's leave, Isuzu lowers her head and withdraws.",
			},
		},
		[478]={
			{
"As the night draws on, even more priests and priestesses will likely depart from us.",
			},
		},
		[479]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[480]={
			{
"Peering up at the night sky, Akari lets out a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[481]={
			{
"─It's all my fault.",
			},
		},
		[482]={
			{
"Those are surely the words on Akari's lips.",
			},
		},
		[483]={
			{
"But she'll not permit herself to voice those words of self-reproach.",
			},
		},
		[484]={
			{
"She knows full well that as one who leads the battle, such words are nothing more than a sign of dependence.",
			},
		},
		[485]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What we need is power.”",
			},
		},
		[486]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah. We have to get stronger.”",
			},
		},
		[487]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Have yourself a niiice, long talk with Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[488]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The pathetic Tokita Soujin, or the strong Mitsurugi. Which one do you need right now?”",
			},
		},
		[489]={
			{
"Kahaku's parting words to me have been echoing in my head ever since.",
			},
		},
		[490]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hate to admit it, but everything Kahaku said was true.”",
			},
		},
		[491]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I...”",
			},
		},
		[492]={
			{
"Akari's eyes stare into mine.",
			},
		},
		[493]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I didn't want you to leave me.”",
			},
		},
		[494]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was scared that once you became Mitsurugi, you'd come to serve the Founding Empress instead.”",
			},
		},
		[495]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And I was just as scared of giving my body over to her.”",
			},
		},
		[496]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though I said I wanted power... my heart was too weak!”",
			},
		},
		[497]={
			{
"Akari bites down hard on her lip.",
			},
		},
		[498]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I've found my resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[499]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right now, I want power more than anything.”",
			},
		},
		[500]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if I have to give all of myself over to the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[501]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I feel the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[502]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My identity as Tokita Soujin, my role as your vassal... Of course, those are important to me.”",
			},
		},
		[503]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I need to be strong enough that I can defend the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[504]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, even then, I have to keep getting stronger.”",
			},
		},
		[505]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Without power, all that's precious will be taken from me.”",
			},
		},
		[506]={
			{
"Just like how the Empire took everything from Yagi Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[507]={
			{
"Just like how the Republic subjugated the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[508]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go to Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[509]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now that Kotone's been abducted, our only lead for unlocking the Founding Empress's power lies in the Shireiden.”",
			},
		},
		[510]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I can claim my power, I'm sure you'll be able to return to being Mitsurugi as well.”",
			},
		},
		[511]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll have to bet on that.”",
			},
		},
		[512]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As I am now, I have no hope of besting Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[513]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Unless we stop him, he'll only continue sowing more and more tragedy across the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[514]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Far more terrible tragedies than even the war three years ago.”",
			},
		},
		[515]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll gain the power to put a stop to him.”",
			},
		},
		[516]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Right.”",
			},
		},
		[517]={
			{
"Nodding firmly to me, Akari turns to gaze up at the moon shining high in the sky.",
			},
		},
		[518]={
			{
"That pale sliver of waning light is an accurate reflection of our current disposition.",
			},
		},
		[519]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll become the Founding Empress, and you'll become Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[520]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Both of us need to return to who we once were two thousand years ago.”",
			},
		},
		[521]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Perhaps that was the fate written in our stars from the moment we were born.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
